    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting go...\" it's just that the quiet is so heavy. it's not peace, it's just nothingness. and i'm just tired of fighting to stay relevant in a world that only cared about the athlete, not the person. if the story is already over, like you said, why is there so much pressure to keep dragging the corpoose around? it feels like i'm just haunting my own life.",
